   "text": "Corresponding source for the GPL/LGPL parts of the ЯVM Linux image egg rvm-linux 0.1.0 (RVM-LINUX-0.1.0.rzl). Published next to the eggs on both hosts: https://rizal.info/src/rvm-linux-0.1.0/ and https://rizal.pw/src/rvm-linux-0.1.0/ . Read with: rzl-doc cat SOURCE.rzl"
